  "title": "Vertiv Introduces Vertiv Liebert® EXM UPS Quick Delivery Bundle for U.S. Customers",
  "summary": "Vertiv, formerly Emerson Network Power, today introduced a quick configure and delivery option for the Vertiv™ Liebert® EXM UPS system, making it possible to add 10-40 kVA of UPS capacity anywhere in the continental U.S. within four days. The units are highly configurable and address the market’s increasing need for robust computing at the network edge.",
